    "title": "Roadway reopens in Alachua County after deadly crash involving motorcycle - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ryan Wyatt Turbeville ,\n8 hours ago LACROSSE, Fla. (WCJB) - Authorities say a major roadway has reopened after a deadly crash involving a motorcycle in Northwest Alachua County. Florida Highway Patrol troopers say a 67-year-old man was killed, while a 74-year-old woman from Mentor, Ohio was taken to the hospital with critical injuries after a motorcycle and a car collided on Wednesday afternoon. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
